    songTitle: "MOS U LARGO (Don't Go)",
    bioGreeting: "Hi everybody!\nThis is Ainhoa Feal representing Albania in the HCSC for the 12th time.\nThis year I am bringing an uptempo track called ‘Mos u largo (Don’t go)’ where I talk about asking someone, your loved one, to stay with you a bit longer because sometimes time is not enough.\nInstead of being so deep like in last year’s entry ‘Përtej kohës’, I started creating this song from the catchy chorus that got stuck in my mind and this is the final result after some back and forths: a dance pop song with some Albanian ethnic elements.\nHope you like it and I wish all the luck to this year’s contestants :)",
